    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like \"rest\" though. it feels like the well is just dry. like there's nothing left underneath the surface. i've spent my whole life thinking that if i stopped creating, i'd stop existing. and now that i can't do it... i feel like i've already stopped. it's just a hollow shell going through the motions.",
